          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Do you ever feel like your favorite shirt is just a little too snug around the neck? At Cochic, we believe style should never come at the cost of comfort. That’s where our collar extenders come in – the discreet, elegant solution to enhance your fit without compromising on looks.</p>"
